{"content_hash": "b9a7fb24424ad0ad", "version_id": 592, "article_id": 60, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Eight rescued orangutans go back to the wild in Borneo", "title_zh": "八只获救的红毛猩猩在婆罗洲重回大自然", "has_translation": true, "topic": "science", "source": "bbc_science", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/c6073z5rvrk3o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586778538929-ee34a8e9d8e7?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8d2F0Y2glMjBlbmRhbmdlcmVkJTIwb3Jhbmd1dGFuc3xlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkxNzY1NzczfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Dan Dennis on Unsplash", "author": "Dan Dennis", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@cameramandan83?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/brown-monkey-on-brown-wooden-log-during-daytime-5ESfIy0yjZY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(180, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(218, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SCIENCE", "seed": "459c4da79085"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-12", "word_count": 113, "reading_minutes": 0.6, "lead": "Eight orangutans are free again in Borneo. People saved them from big fires. The fires burned their forest in August and September.", "lead_zh": "八只红毛猩猩在婆罗洲重获自由。人们把它们从大火中救了出来。这场大火在八九月烧毁了它们的森林。", "preview": "The eight orangutans went back to the wild on Friday. Three mothers, their three daughters, and two adult males were freed. They now live in", "preview_zh": "这八只红毛猩猩在周五回到了野外。三只妈妈、她们的三只女儿，还有两只成年雄性被放归自然。它们现在住在岛屿西部的一个保护区里。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 581, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/60/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 45.312, "size_bytes": 275616, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 128, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@2bf0132/content/data/versions/592.json", "paragraphs": ["The eight orangutans went back to the wild on Friday. Three mothers, their three daughters, and two adult males were freed. They now live in a reserve in the west of the island.", "Indonesian wildlife workers rescued 46 of these apes. The animals are critically endangered. Workers saved them before fires tore through their home in August and September.", "The fires were very strong and destroyed a lot of forest. Orangutans need trees to live and find food. Without trees, they cannot survive in the wild.", "This is good news for the animals. Many people work hard to protect orangutans in Borneo. The eight apes can now live free again in the forest."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这八只红毛猩猩在周五回到了野外。三只妈妈、她们的三只女儿，还有两只成年雄性被放归自然。它们现在住在岛屿西部的一个保护区里。", "印尼的野生动物工作人员救出了46只这种猿类。这些动物属于极度濒危物种。工作人员在八九月大火烧毁它们的家园之前把它们救了出来。", "大火非常猛烈，烧毁了大片森林。红毛猩猩需要树木来生活和寻找食物。没有树木，它们就无法在野外生存。", "这对这些动物来说是个好消息。许多人努力保护婆罗洲的红毛猩猩。这八只猿现在又能在森林里自由生活了。"], "body": "The eight orangutans went back to the wild on Friday. Three mothers, their three daughters, and two adult males were freed. They now live in a reserve in the west of the island.\n\nIndonesian wildlife workers rescued 46 of these apes. The animals are critically endangered. Workers saved them before fires tore through their home in August and September.\n\nThe fires were very strong and destroyed a lot of forest. Orangutans need trees to live and find food. Without trees, they cannot survive in the wild.\n\nThis is good news for the animals. Many people work hard to protect orangutans in Borneo. The eight apes can now live free again in the forest.", "body_zh": "这八只红毛猩猩在周五回到了野外。三只妈妈、她们的三只女儿，还有两只成年雄性被放归自然。它们现在住在岛屿西部的一个保护区里。\n\n印尼的野生动物工作人员救出了46只这种猿类。这些动物属于极度濒危物种。工作人员在八九月大火烧毁它们的家园之前把它们救了出来。\n\n大火非常猛烈，烧毁了大片森林。红毛猩猩需要树木来生活和寻找食物。没有树木，它们就无法在野外生存。\n\n这对这些动物来说是个好消息。许多人努力保护婆罗洲的红毛猩猩。这八只猿现在又能在森林里自由生活了。", "text": "The eight orangutans went back to the wild on Friday. Three mothers, their three daughters, and two adult males were freed. They now live in a reserve in the west of the island. Indonesian wildlife workers rescued 46 of these apes. The animals are critically endangered. Workers saved them before fires tore through their home in August and September. The fires were very strong and destroyed a lot of forest. Orangutans need trees to live and find food. Without trees, they cannot survive in the wild. This is good news for the animals. Many people work hard to protect orangutans in Borneo. The eight apes can now live free again in the forest.", "vocab": [{"word": "orangutan", "pos": "noun", "zh": "红毛猩猩", "note": "一种大型猿类，生活在婆罗洲和苏门答腊", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rescue", "pos": "verb", "zh": "营救，救出", "note": "常用被动语态：were rescued", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "wild", "pos": "noun", "zh": "野外，大自然", "note": "in the wild 表示“在野外”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "endangered", "pos": "adj", "zh": "濒危的", "note": "critically endangered 表示“极度濒危”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fire", "pos": "noun", "zh": "火灾，大火", "note": "wildfire 指“野火”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "reserve", "pos": "noun", "zh": "保护区", "note": "指为保护动物而设立的区域", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "forest", "pos": "noun", "zh": "森林", "note": "常见搭配：destroy the forest 毁坏森林", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "survive", "pos": "verb", "zh": "生存，存活", "note": "表示在困难条件下活下来", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Watch: Endangered orangutans released back into the wild after Borneo fires", "summary_original": "The critically endangered apes were rescued from intense wildfires that destroyed their habitat in August and September.", "body_original": "Watch: Endangered orangutans released back into the wild after Borneo fires\nTo play this video you need to enable JavaScript in your browser.\nThis video can not be played\nWatch: Endangered orangutans released back into the wild after Borneo fires\nClose\nEight orangutans have been released into the wild in Borneo after bein